[
    {
        "content": "<p>Hi all, I've pushed up a circuit model I've been refining for a while and I finally thought was good enough to push up to CSLib. I'll include the distilled version of it here for ease of discussion. PR is here: <a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover/cslib/pull/841\">https://github.com/leanprover/cslib/pull/841</a>.</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">structure</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Signature</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">where</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">Op</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">v</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">Arity</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Op</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">structure</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Application</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">σ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Signature</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">τ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">where</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">op</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">σ</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Op</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">args</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Fin</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">σ</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Arity</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">op</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">τ</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">abbrev</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Interpretation</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">σ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Signature</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">τ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Application</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">σ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">τ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">τ</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">abbrev</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Wire</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">g</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Fin</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">g</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">inductive</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Program</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">σ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Signature</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">where</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">empty</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Program</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">σ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">gate</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">g</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Program</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">σ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">g</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Application</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">σ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">Wire</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">g</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Program</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">σ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">g</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">structure</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Circuit</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">σ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Signature</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">g</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">m</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">where</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">program</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Program</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">σ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">g</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">outputs</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Fin</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">m</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Wire</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">g</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Application</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">map</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">σ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"o\">}</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">application</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Application</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">σ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Application</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">σ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">where</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">op</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">application</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">op</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">args</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">λ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">↦</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">application</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">args</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Application</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">eval</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">σ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">τ</span><span class=\"o\">}</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">application</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Application</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">σ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">interpretation</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Interpretation</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">σ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">τ</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">input</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">τ</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">τ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">interpretation</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">application</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">map</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">input</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Program</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">gates</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">σ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">g</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">τ</span><span class=\"o\">}</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">program</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Program</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">σ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">g</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">interpretation</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Interpretation</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">σ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">τ</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">input</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Fin</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">τ</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Fin</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">g</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">τ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">match</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">program</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">with</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">empty</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Fin</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">elim0</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">gate</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">beginning</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">application</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">beginning_gates</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">beginning</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">gates</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">interpretation</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">input</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">Fin</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">lastCases</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">interpretation</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">application</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">map</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">Fin</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">addCases</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">input</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">beginning_gates</span><span class=\"o\">)))</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">beginning_gates</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Circuit</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">eval</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">σ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">g</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">m</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">τ</span><span class=\"o\">}</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">circuit</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Circuit</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">σ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">g</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">m</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">interpretation</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Interpretation</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">σ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">τ</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">input</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Fin</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">τ</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Fin</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">m</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">τ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">gates</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">circuit</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">program</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">gates</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">interpretation</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">input</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">λ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">↦</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Fin</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">addCases</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">input</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">gates</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">circuit</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">outputs</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>This Is meant to cover arithmetic and boolean circuits and arbitrary bases in each. There are lots of nice lower bounds like Schnorr's 3(n-1) parity lower bound we can get relatively easily if we merge something like this.</p>",
        "id": 619648482,
        "sender_full_name": "Sam Schlesinger",
        "timestamp": 1787863685
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Note, both Alex and I already have circuits. It’s worth a comparison.</p>",
        "id": 619656896,
        "sender_full_name": "Shreyas Srinivas",
        "timestamp": 1787867008
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Concretely Alex seems to have an easier way to prove lower bounds and mine is easier for upper bounds.</p>",
        "id": 619656947,
        "sender_full_name": "Shreyas Srinivas",
        "timestamp": 1787867038
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Links are helpful, though I assume yours are in <code>Algolean</code>. Indeed, this is the right place to compare the various approaches.</p>",
        "id": 619657048,
        "sender_full_name": "Sam Schlesinger",
        "timestamp": 1787867090
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Looks like Algolean/Models/Circuits.lean</p>",
        "id": 619657171,
        "sender_full_name": "Sam Schlesinger",
        "timestamp": 1787867138
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Yeah and FanInTwoCircuits</p>",
        "id": 619657217,
        "sender_full_name": "Shreyas Srinivas",
        "timestamp": 1787867158
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>There’s also a log depth n input And example in Algorithms for fan-in two circuits.</p>",
        "id": 619657289,
        "sender_full_name": "Shreyas Srinivas",
        "timestamp": 1787867199
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>I’d also compare it with Quantum circuits.</p>",
        "id": 619657359,
        "sender_full_name": "Shreyas Srinivas",
        "timestamp": 1787867230
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>From what I can see, Algolean/Models/Circuits.lean is a formula not a circuit but you end up de-duplicating when you count size?</p>",
        "id": 619657376,
        "sender_full_name": "Sam Schlesinger",
        "timestamp": 1787867239
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>I think my approach can capture all of these so far.</p>",
        "id": 619657397,
        "sender_full_name": "Sam Schlesinger",
        "timestamp": 1787867252
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Exactly.</p>",
        "id": 619657400,
        "sender_full_name": "Shreyas Srinivas",
        "timestamp": 1787867254
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>It’s easier to program a formula and then count it as a circuit as far I can tell</p>",
        "id": 619657432,
        "sender_full_name": "Shreyas Srinivas",
        "timestamp": 1787867276
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>That is not my experience so far, I like how the approach I'm taking can work in stages where you construct a circuit with higher-level operations then you lower them via a translation.</p>",
        "id": 619657612,
        "sender_full_name": "Sam Schlesinger",
        "timestamp": 1787867346
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>I don’t understand. Do you have examples?</p>",
        "id": 619657769,
        "sender_full_name": "Shreyas Srinivas",
        "timestamp": 1787867411
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>There are times where the recursive representation is convenient and I think we can also have a generalized variant of that with this approach.</p>",
        "id": 619657773,
        "sender_full_name": "Sam Schlesinger",
        "timestamp": 1787867412
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>For comparison I can offer the and circuits a masters student wrote and quantum circuits.</p>",
        "id": 619657856,
        "sender_full_name": "Shreyas Srinivas",
        "timestamp": 1787867448
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Happy to see other variations.</p>",
        "id": 619657990,
        "sender_full_name": "Sam Schlesinger",
        "timestamp": 1787867510
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>This representation is particularly nice for Fusion based lower bounds, see Wigderson's 1993 survey. That survey is part of what inspired me to take this representation.</p>",
        "id": 619658124,
        "sender_full_name": "Sam Schlesinger",
        "timestamp": 1787867577
    },
    {
        "content": "<blockquote>\n<p>I don’t understand. Do you have examples?</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>The idea is that you can use a <code>Signature</code> with higher level operations like <code>DotProduct</code> or <code>MatMul</code> or whatever and lower that to an arithmetic circuit with a <code>Signature</code> with just <code>add</code> and <code>mul</code>.</p>",
        "id": 619658261,
        "sender_full_name": "Sam Schlesinger",
        "timestamp": 1787867639
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>You can also see a few different circuit models in Complexitylib where we have various circuit lower bounds.</p>",
        "id": 619658420,
        "sender_full_name": "Sam Schlesinger",
        "timestamp": 1787867708
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>I have ended up proving novel results on this circuit model, in particular improved mass production upper bounds. I am not totally sure, but this may be one of the first examples of novel complexity work being based on CSLib though of course it is not in CSLib yet.</p>",
        "id": 621918827,
        "sender_full_name": "Sam Schlesinger",
        "timestamp": 1788621323
    },
    {
